: - Keep the directory to policy files only; the catalog scan ignores hidden\n\n  Line 88:   policies).\n\n\n/workspace/docs/jobs/archive/medical_policies/tasks.md:\n  Line 1: # Tasks: policies\n\n  Line 11: Add a new top-level `policies/` directory to the defaults catalog and author a\n\n  Line 12: small set of global policy files (`policies/<name>.md`), one rule per file,\n\n  Line 14: the four decision criteria in the brief (\"skills-vs-policies line\") are the\n\n  Line 20: - Do **not** add a `README`, hidden files, or symlinks inside `policies/` — the\n\n  Line 21:   brief says keep the directory to policy files only (the catalog scan ignores\n\n  Line 37: - The brief's `~70 more` skills and manigot's `internal/session/policies.go` /\n\n  Line 43: ### TASK-1 — Author `policies/secrets-hygiene.md`\n\n  Line 45: - **Description**: Create the global policy file forbidding committing,\n\n  Line 49: - **Files**: `policies/secrets-hygiene.md` (new)\n\n  Line 54: ### TASK-2 — Author `policies/no-debug-leftovers.md`\n\n  Line 56: - **Description**: Create the global policy file requiring that no debug\n\n  Line 59: - **Files**: `policies/no-debug-leftovers.md` (new)\n\n  Line 63: ### TASK-3 — Author `policies/smallest-change.md`\n\n  Line 65: - **Description**: Create the global policy file requiring the smallest change\n\n  Line 69: - **Files**: `policies/smallest-change.md` (new)\n\n  Line 74: ### TASK-4 — Author `policies/ask-before-adding-dependencies.md`\n\n  Line 76: - **Description**: Create the global policy file requiring explicit approval\n\n  Line 78: - **Files**: `policies/ask-before-adding-dependencies.md` (new)\n\n  Line 83: ### TASK-5 — Author `policies/keep-it-committed.md`\n\n  Line 85: - **Description**: Create the global policy file requiring that no uncommitted\n\n  Line 87: - **Files**: `policies/keep-it-committed.md` (new)\n\n  Line 91: ### TASK-6 — Audit the new `policies/` set against the brief's criteria\n\n  Line 93: - **Description**: Compare all files under `policies/` against the brief's four\n\n  Line 99: - **Files**: `policies/*.md` (may be edited or, if a file fails the criteria,\n\n  Line 109:   suggestion\"). These tasks author all five proposed policies and rely on\n\n  Line 110:   TASK-6 to enforce the criteria; if a policy fails, the brief's intent is to\n","metadata":{"matches":92,"truncated":false},"title":"polic","time":{"start":1791733739406,"end":1791733739449}},"id":"prt_12ba72ef8001AaSHRR7zTO7Noj","sessionID":"ses_ed459432affebR6xC0AIZfMpXB","messageID":"msg_12ba72238001cd32vQc9qhSuJT"}}
