{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791734109806,"sessionID":"ses_ed4533d96ffeHX0igUlp1xblch","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_00_pJO29JVSVrEUpBAzThUC9978","state":{"status":"error","input":{"command":"ls -la /workspace/docs/jobs/prior_new-policy-playwright-only-if-necessary"},"error":"The user has specified a rule which prevents you from using this specific tool call. Here are some of the relevant rules [{\"permission\":\"*\",\"action\":\"allow\",\"pattern\":\"*\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git add\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git add *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git commit\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git commit *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git diff\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git diff *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch --show-current\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch --show-current *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git status\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git status *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git log\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git log *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git rev-parse\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git rev-parse *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git show\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git show *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git worktree*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch -d*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch -D*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch --delete*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch --move*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch --copy*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git reset*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git clean*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git gc*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git prune*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git reflog*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git push*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git fetch*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git pull*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git checkout*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git switch*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git restore*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git stash*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git remote*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git tag -d*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git update-ref*\",\"action\":\"deny\"}]","time":{"start":1791734109702,"end":1791734109792}},"id":"prt_12bacd5a0001VVQum7dgBixBGe","sessionID":"ses_ed4533d96ffeHX0igUlp1xblch","messageID":"msg_12bacc689001khP6f53Zt5X8kY"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791734109963,"sessionID":"ses_ed4533d96ffeHX0igUlp1xblch","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_01_0U7ggqft6955ti1rs8Ce9520","state":{"status":"error","input":{"command":"git -C /workspace branch --show-current; git -C /workspace status"},"error":"The user has specified a rule which prevents you from using this specific tool call. Here are some of the relevant rules [{\"permission\":\"*\",\"action\":\"allow\",\"pattern\":\"*\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git add\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git add *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git commit\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git commit *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git diff\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git diff *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch --show-current\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch --show-current *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git status\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git status *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git log\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git log *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git rev-parse\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git rev-parse *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git show\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git show *\",\"action\":\"allow\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git worktree*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch -d*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch -D*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch --delete*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch --move*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git branch --copy*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git reset*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git clean*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git gc*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git prune*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git reflog*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git push*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git fetch*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git pull*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git checkout*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git switch*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git restore*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git stash*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git remote*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git tag -d*\",\"action\":\"deny\"},{\"permission\":\"bash\",\"pattern\":\"git update-ref*\",\"action\":\"deny\"}]","time":{"start":1791734109951,"end":1791734109957}},"id":"prt_12bacd62b001o14pw3yfNAWys7","sessionID":"ses_ed4533d96ffeHX0igUlp1xblch","messageID":"msg_12bacc689001khP6f53Zt5X8kY"}}
